WEBVTT

00:02:03.370 --> 00:02:06.340
It sure feels great getting up early!

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:15.050
Yes, yes yes yes!

00:02:15.050 --> 00:02:17.540
Yes? Ah, <i>Ricki-san!</i>

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:23.950
Huh? Dinner? I'll go! Sure I'll go! I've got the whole day off, after all.

00:02:25.390 --> 00:02:28.590
Right now? It's too early!

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:32.370
Because it's still early in the morning... huh?

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:38.670
It's evening?

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:40.970
It's evening...

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:55.360
I sure blew it, sleeping the whole day away.

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:57.190
After sleeping that much,

00:02:57.190 --> 00:02:59.690
you won't go napping at your receptionist job tomorrow, huh?

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:03.030
But this was my day off.

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:04.830
Don't let it get you down, don't let it get you down.

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:07.700
I'm going to let you in on a delicious shop, so cheer up!

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:10.370
A delicious shop?

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:11.710
Thank you so much!

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:14.070
However, we're splitting the bill.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:33.660
It looks like kind of an expensive shop, huh?

00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:35.700
You just got paid, didn't you?

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:39.030
You have to indulge yourself every once in a while, to refine your feminine side.

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:50.010
I'm terribly sorry...

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:55.020
...but we do not allow the admission of minors into our establishment.

00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:58.350
Oh, that's okay! She's one of my colleagues from work.

00:03:58.350 --> 00:04:00.020
That is not what the issue is...

00:04:00.020 --> 00:04:03.020
So what, you pick and choose your customers here?

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:05.030
No, it's absolutely nothing like that...

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:08.030
Um, <i>Ricki-san,</i> I could go to some other place.

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:09.360
Welcome!

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:11.370
Please, let them in.

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:13.370
Y- yeah, but tonight...

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:16.370
Please excuse us. Be my guest.

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:17.860
Thanks!

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:22.380
Are you sure this is okay? Tonight...

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:24.280
If we keep the regular customers away,

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:26.110
it will only draw that much more attention.

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:26.710
Besides,

00:04:26.710 --> 00:04:29.320
we must not forget that having decorative flowers on hand

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:31.990
will serve to soften the air of anxiety.

00:04:31.990 --> 00:04:35.010
Slightly tawdry flowers though they might be.

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:39.890
We have been expecting you.

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:44.330
Insider trading?

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:49.670
Yes. The controls on financial activities here on Aineias are pretty loose, right?

00:04:49.670 --> 00:04:53.770
It seems that an unprincipled hedge fund group and Laughing Jester

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:54.680
are conspiring together.

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:56.380
Laughing Jester?

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:58.810
The underground organization dealing in the financial world's secret information,

00:04:58.810 --> 00:05:00.010
right?

00:05:00.010 --> 00:05:04.350
We were planning to catch them in the act after determining their location,

00:05:04.350 --> 00:05:07.350
but we still haven't gotten any information on them.

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:09.120
As the cities flourish,

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:11.690
the structures of the underworld also become more complicated.

00:05:11.690 --> 00:05:14.700
This is not going to be all that simple.

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:17.700
Such is the world. Such is life.

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:20.370
Wow! They have the greatest atmosphere here!

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:24.040
Don't they? I wonder if we should have invited Lumiere, too.

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:27.110
That's all right, that's all right. I have to see her every day,

00:05:27.110 --> 00:05:28.710
so I need to stretch my wings every once in a while.

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:30.710
Is that how it is?

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:32.740
That's how it is!

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:44.850
Are you sure this is all right? Not telling <i>Éclair-sama,</i> I mean?

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:48.600
It's fine. This is her day off, too,

00:05:48.600 --> 00:05:52.000
so she probably wants to get through it without having to see my face.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:55.700
But then, if one of her hobbies was taking in operas,

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:57.670
I would have invited her.

00:05:57.670 --> 00:06:00.340
Okay then, I'll be going.

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:02.040
Have a safe trip.

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:07.680
That looks delicious! Let's start eating!

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:09.680
That was some fairly good cooking.

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:12.350
I'm glad you found it agreeable.

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:16.360
Still, you folks have your hand in many different types of business, huh?

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:20.030
It's the spreading of roots underground that causes the greenery above to thrive.

00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:23.700
There's also an expression about what it is that lies below the cherry blossom.

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:28.070
I see. I'm glad that we have gained such promising friends.

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:33.640
Ah, I'm full, I'm full!

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:35.640
Geez, you've got no sex appeal.

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:38.650
But then, I've got another stomach just for ice cream, you know?

00:06:38.650 --> 00:06:39.650
Sure, sure.

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:41.320
Miss...

00:06:41.320 --> 00:06:44.990
May I ask for your hand?

00:06:44.990 --> 00:06:46.750
Yes.

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:56.330
Delicious! What a joy!

00:06:56.330 --> 00:07:00.330
Sure enough, you bring along a little girl, and nobody comes calling on you.

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:02.530
Did you say something?

00:07:03.340 --> 00:07:05.270
Don't move.

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:10.010
What are you doing!? Just a minute, now! <i>Ricki-san,</i> no!

00:07:10.010 --> 00:07:11.640
Don't move!

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:18.690
All done! What do you think? Now you look a little more grown up, don't you?

00:07:18.690 --> 00:07:21.360
This is going to get me into trouble, <i>Rick-san!</i>

00:07:21.360 --> 00:07:25.190
It's okay, it's okay! You're always carrying lipstick around with you,

00:07:25.190 --> 00:07:27.360
but you don't use it very much, do you?

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:31.370
<i>When I put lipstick on, it becomes difficult to control my power.</i>

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:32.300
Éclair...

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:33.300
Yes?

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:36.790
You're pretty! Have some courage!

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:40.640
Miss...

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:42.310
Yes!?

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:44.900
Can I ask you to accompany me?

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:49.980
Me? B- but I...

00:07:49.980 --> 00:07:51.990
That's okay! Go on!

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:55.320
But I... Now, just a second!

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:57.190
Here...

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:13.670
Is this your first time dancing?

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:17.870
I wouldn't say that. It's just that today I'm a little...

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:24.050
- What was that? - A bomb!?

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:31.360
It appears to have been an earthquake.

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:35.960
I would like you to relax. We wouldn't do anything to harm our friends.

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:38.560
Your words are most welcome.

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:46.310
<i>I knew it! I knew this was going to end up badly.</i>

00:08:46.310 --> 00:08:50.310
You are trembling. Were you scared by that earthquake?

00:08:50.310 --> 00:08:52.070
Yeah, well...

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:58.990
You are an adorable lady. Might I ask your name?

00:08:58.990 --> 00:09:01.320
É- Éclair.

00:09:01.320 --> 00:09:06.660
Éclair..."Lightning." It is a beautiful name.

00:09:06.660 --> 00:09:08.330
Éclair,

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:13.330
do you believe in destiny?

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:17.000
The universe is vast, and life is short.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:22.530
I believe that we should make much of the fateful encounters that God grants us.

00:09:23.340 --> 00:09:24.680
Just a minute!

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:26.540
Stop that!

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:32.340
What's going on over there?

00:09:35.290 --> 00:09:37.290
Who is this!? One of your gunmen!?

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:39.290
N- no! You misunderstand!

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:42.820
No use trying to explain! I thought it was something like this!

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:51.640
What?

00:09:51.640 --> 00:09:53.870
What? What's going on?

00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:03.980
Aw, and this was a new one!

00:10:03.980 --> 00:10:05.320
Is she our adversary too?

00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:07.720
A cyborg! This will be fun!

00:10:11.990 --> 00:10:14.360
Why is this happening!?

00:10:17.330 --> 00:10:20.060
Éclair! Where are you? Éclair!

00:10:22.670 --> 00:10:35.740
Éclair!

00:10:54.970 --> 00:10:58.960
Erbschaft's <i>"La Traviata."</i> It's been a long time.

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:14.320
There, there, what's the matter?

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:16.990
Did you get separated from your mama?

00:11:16.990 --> 00:11:21.620
Don't cry. I'll take care of this.

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:41.310
That's a good girl.

00:12:07.710 --> 00:12:10.380
You're an illegal cyborg, huh?

00:12:10.380 --> 00:12:13.710
You might even call yourself a free bouncer.

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:17.380
Who would have thought that shop was the center of insider trading?

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:20.390
Thanks to you, my precious day off has been ruined!

00:12:20.390 --> 00:12:25.390
It made for a good front, but thanks to you, we'll have to close up shop.

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:26.790
On top of that,

00:12:26.790 --> 00:12:30.060
you also spoiled the contract we were setting up with that group.

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:33.670
Let me just say that I didn't do it on purpose...!

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:35.070
I don't care!

00:12:35.070 --> 00:12:37.370
It was a relationship where either one of us would betray the other

00:12:37.370 --> 00:12:38.670
if given a chance.

00:12:38.670 --> 00:12:43.240
However, thanks to you, our schedule has been thrown off.

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:46.010
You're going to have to compensate us for that!

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:50.680
l- I'm poor! I can't get any workmen's compensation insurance, or anything.

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:55.050
I don't mean money. You're going to put your body to work for us.

00:13:12.710 --> 00:13:14.370
Where am I?

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:39.660
This doesn't appear to be some elementary school camp.

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:51.350
I heard those Laughing bastards double-crossed us.

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:55.020
They what? Then, they could be coming after this ship, couldn't they?

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:57.120
Yeah, it's possible.

00:13:57.120 --> 00:14:01.020
We have to hurry and carry our cargo to the treatment facility.

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:02.750
<i>Treatment facility?</i>

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:06.260
It looks like our departure is going to be rushed.

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:08.360
Make blastoff preparations immediately!

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:10.590
<i>Departure? Blastoff?</i>

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:13.390
<i>The spaceport!</i>

00:14:26.710 --> 00:14:30.050
Ever since this became a war, a first strike means certain victory.

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:32.520
The first thing we do is make a raid

00:14:32.520 --> 00:14:34.320
on the opposing organization's transport ship.

00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:35.990
And what are they carrying?

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:37.320
Children.

00:14:37.320 --> 00:14:38.990
Children!?

00:14:38.990 --> 00:14:42.560
These guys kidnap upper-class children

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:45.670
and place post-hypnotic suggestions into their subconscious minds.

00:14:45.670 --> 00:14:48.340
The effects of the suggestions do not appear right away.

00:14:48.340 --> 00:14:51.810
However, after a set time has gone by,

00:14:51.810 --> 00:14:55.340
they come to take whatever action the organization tells them to.

00:14:55.340 --> 00:14:59.350
They use the children to kidnap still more children.

00:14:59.350 --> 00:15:02.020
Timed hypnotic suggestions...

00:15:02.020 --> 00:15:06.920
If these suggestions become manifest once these children become adults

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:08.690
and reach the upper levels of society...

00:15:08.690 --> 00:15:12.060
...they will become puppets of the organization, then?

00:15:12.060 --> 00:15:14.030
That's quite a long-term plan, huh?

00:15:14.030 --> 00:15:16.360
However, the effect is tremendous.

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:18.630
They can make high officeholders in the political and financial worlds...

00:15:18.630 --> 00:15:22.040
no, even prime ministers their subordinates, after all.

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:24.040
It's not a bad idea.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:28.310
So, you guys are trying to steal that idea from them?

00:15:28.310 --> 00:15:30.710
I doubt you're in this to return them to their homes.

00:15:32.980 --> 00:15:37.120
So long as you work for me, I'll write that earlier matter off.

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:39.320
I'll even send other jobs your way.

00:15:39.320 --> 00:15:42.380
S- sure. I'll do whatever little I can.

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:03.780
Now that I know about this,

00:16:03.780 --> 00:16:06.470
I can't very well escape from here all by myself.

00:16:17.690 --> 00:16:20.250
It's like storming the Pied Piper's castle.

00:16:33.640 --> 00:16:36.310
The enemy is a squadron of light-figure Tyrs!

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:38.650
Return fire! And hurry up the preparations for blastoff!

00:16:38.650 --> 00:16:40.650
Make sure there's nothing funny going on with the cargo!

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:41.640
Roger!

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:52.990
Your capsule opened, did it? Hey you, go back to where you started out!

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:57.050
This is why I cant stand children. Come, don't cause any trouble!

00:17:03.670 --> 00:17:08.900
I know what you mean. A crying child tends to make you drop your guard, huh?

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:30.760
That is a far cry from elegance.

00:17:41.980 --> 00:17:46.650
Someone's hacking in! Somebody is using the satellite circuits to hack into us!

00:17:46.650 --> 00:17:50.320
What!? Figure out what route they're coming in on, and try to hack <i>them!</i>

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:51.580
R- right!

00:17:52.990 --> 00:17:54.850
l- I can't guard against them!

00:17:56.660 --> 00:17:59.090
What's wrong? What's going on!?

00:18:02.330 --> 00:18:03.600
This is hacking!

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:06.090
Looks like they've got somebody like a little miss someone I know.

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:08.660
W- what does that girl think she's doing!?

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:10.000
What are you doing!? Get us out of here!

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:12.060
A- as far as that goes...

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:43.630
I will vouch for those two.

00:19:43.630 --> 00:19:48.300
The children who were given suggestions have all been admitted into the hospital.

00:19:48.300 --> 00:19:50.670
A list of the other children who they have treated up to now

00:19:50.670 --> 00:19:52.640
has been submitted to the authorities,

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:53.940
and after some follow-up investigation,

00:19:53.940 --> 00:19:56.640
they will all have their suggestions removed as well.

00:19:56.640 --> 00:20:00.310
Both of you sure did work hard on your day off, huh?

00:20:00.310 --> 00:20:01.910
So, where is 'Lai?

00:20:23.340 --> 00:20:24.670
Ah, Mer!

00:20:24.670 --> 00:20:29.010
That's a pretty song. Where did you learn it?

00:20:29.010 --> 00:20:30.010
Beats me.

00:20:30.010 --> 00:20:31.340
"Beat's me?"

00:20:31.340 --> 00:20:33.870
I just knew it for some reason.

00:20:35.280 --> 00:20:39.450
Don't cry, don't cry! Your mama will be here to pick you up very soon.

00:20:39.450 --> 00:20:40.620
Don't cry.

00:20:40.620 --> 00:20:44.620
Oh, don't cry any more, I tell you! Look, I'll sing you some more.

00:20:46.290 --> 00:20:49.960
She looks pretty good like that, huh?

00:20:49.960 --> 00:20:51.300
Yes, she does...

00:21:01.980 --> 00:21:05.310
So there's going to be a roundup of everyone from both organizations?

00:21:06.310 --> 00:21:08.750
And what about those two?

00:21:09.980 --> 00:21:12.580
Huh? A lullaby!?

00:21:13.320 --> 00:21:19.420
Understood. Please tell them not to be late for E-Shift tomorrow morning.

00:23:07.270 --> 00:23:10.600
<i>The mirror shows both a real and a false image.</i>

00:23:10.600 --> 00:23:13.440
<i>When pairs of left and right are reversed,</i>

00:23:13.440 --> 00:23:15.940
<i>light and shadow also switch their places.</i>

00:23:15.940 --> 00:23:20.680
<i>Next time on Kiddy Grade</i>
